'''
Take an input from user while running the program and print the output. Write a script that asks the user to enter a multi-digit number. Use a while loop and arithmetic operators (floor division // and modulo %) to extract each digit, calculate the total sum of all the digits, and print the final sum.
'''

number = int(input("Enter the number : "))
original_number = number

number = abs(number)
digit_sum = 0
while number > 0:
  digit = number % 10
  digit_sum += digit
  number = number // 10

print(f"The sum of digit for number {original_number} : {digit_sum}")
